<section class="section" data-panel="visuals"><section class="panel">
  <header class="panel-head"><div><h2>站点视觉</h2><p>按页面位置更换图片，先保存草稿，再审核和发布。</p></div><button id="visualRefresh" class="button secondary" type="button">更新列表</button></header>
  <div class="toolbar is-row"><label>图片位置 <select id="visualGroup"><option value="home">首页轮播</option><option value="pages">页面 Banner</option><option value="categories">分类 Banner</option></select></label><span class="field-help">只显示站长已开放的位置；恢复默认不会隐藏页面。</span></div>
  <form id="visualForm" class="visual-slots"></form>
  <div class="actions editor-save-bar"><span id="visualStatus" class="status" role="status">正在加载站点图片。</span><button id="visualPreview" class="button secondary" type="button">预览草稿</button><button id="visualSave" class="button" type="button">保存草稿</button></div>
  <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" id="visualShowHistory">显示已完成记录</label>
  <div id="visualDrafts" class="drafts"></div>
</section></section>
